{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10055","headline":"鹤警露 · 陈季","name":"鹤警露","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国商飙动，东臯野鹤鸣。\n溪松寒暂宿，露草滴还惊。\n欲有高飞意，空闻召侣情。\n风间传藻质，月下引清声。\n未假抟扶势，焉知羽翼轻。\n吾君开太液，愿得应皇明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈季","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10055.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10055","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}